  "title": "Expectation effects on repetition suppression in nociception",
  "description": "This dataset contains electroencephalography (EEG) recordings from a study investigating how expectation modulates repetition suppression of neural responses to nociceptive (pain-related) stimuli. It provides raw EEG data organized in BIDS format, intended to support analyses of expectation effects on cortical processing of repeated nociceptive stimulation.",
